   "registered_utc": "2026-11-02T14:38:53.135763Z",
   "change": "queue35.py lock changed to re-entrant: workers deadlocked from about 11:58 UTC when the uk and cut05ext075 designs had to be created inside next_job(); designs generated by designs.py on the registered training baselines, queue relaunched",
